``` CL-08 | Flapping Peer: Up → Pending → Up Cycling
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry CL-08. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH.
    Query: Host pressure on the flapping peer (substitute the peer hostname)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/CL-08-probe.spl to confirm the data it
    reads exists here.
    Replace any <angle-bracket> placeholders before running.
```
index=_introspection sourcetype=splunk_resource_usage component=Hostwide
    host=<peer_host> earliest=-24h
| eval cpu_pct='data.cpu_system_pct'+'data.cpu_user_pct',
       mem_pct=round(100*'data.mem_used'/'data.mem',1)
| timechart span=5m max(cpu_pct) as cpu_pct max(mem_pct) as mem_pct
    max(data.normalized_load_avg_1min) as load_1m
